\par c) T\'aan, \'ae\'dea ch\'d8 c\'f1a b\'aan m\'eai th\'c7u, c\'b8c b\'aan d\'f9 th\'c7u; 
\par d) Gi\'b8 b\'e1 th\'c7u c\'f1a c\'b8c b\'aan d\'f9 th\'c7u; 
\par \'ae) C\'b8c n\'e9i dung s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i, b\'e6 sung v\'b5 c\'b8c n\'e9i dung c\'e3 li\'aan quan, n\'d5u c\'e3.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \loch\af31\dbch\af0\hich\f31 \'a7}{\i0 i\'d2u 227.}{ \'a7\'b8nh gi\'b8 v
