\par 2. C\'b8c ti\'aau chu\'c8n quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i kho\'b6n 1 \'a7i\'d2u n\'b5y \'ae\'ad\'eec \'ae\'b8nh gi\'b8 b\'bbng ph\'ad\'acng ph\'b8p cho \'aei\'d3m theo thang \'aei\'d3m ho\'c6c ph\'ad\'acng ph\'b8p kh\'b8c \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec \'can \'ae\'denh tr
\'ad\'edc khi m\'eb th\'c7u.
