\'f6a \'ae\'e6i h\'e5 s\'ac d\'f9 th\'c7u sau khi \'ae\'b7 m\'eb th\'c7u. 
\par 2. Trong qu\'b8 tr\'d7nh \'ae\'b8nh gi\'b8 v\'b5 so s\'b8nh c\'b8c h\'e5 s\'ac d\'f9 th\'c7u, b\'aan m\'eai th\'c7u c\'e3 th\'d3 y\'aau c\'c7u b\'aan d\'f9 th\'c7u l\'b5m r\'e2 c\'b8c v\'can \'ae\'d2 c\'e3 li\'aan quan \'ae\'d5n h\'e5 s\'ac d\'f9 th\'c7
u. Y\'aau c\'c7u c\'f1a b\'aan m\'eai th\'c7u v\'b5 \'fd ki\'d5n tr\'b6 l\'eai c\'f1a b\'aan d\'f9 th\'c7u ph\'b6i \'ae\'ad\'eec l\'cbp th\'b5nh v\'a8n b\'b6n.
\par 3. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep b\'aan m\'eai th\'c7u s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i m\'e9t s\'e8 n\'e9i dung trong h\'e5 s\'ac m\'eai th\'c7u, b\'aan m\'eai th\'c7u ph\'b6i g\'f6i n\'e9i dung \'ae\'b7 s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i b\'bbng v\'a8n b\'b6n \'ae\'d5n t\'cat c\'b6 c\'b8c b\'aa
n d\'f9 th\'c7u tr\'ad\'edc th\'eai h\'b9n cu\'e8i c\'efng n\'e9p h\'e5 s\'ac d\'f9 th\'c7u \'ddt nh\'cat l\'b5 m\'ad\'eai ng\'b5y \'ae\'d3 c\'b8c b\'aan d\'f9 th\'c7u c\'e3 \'aei\'d2u ki\'d6n ho\'b5n ch\'d8nh th\'aam h\'e5 s\'ac d\'f9 th\'c7u c\'f1a m
\'d7nh.
