\par 1. Trong th\'eai h\'b9n thu\'aa, b\'aan cho thu\'aa ph\'b6i ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 b\'cat k\'fa khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t n\'b5o c\'f1a h\'b5ng ho\'b8 cho thu\'aa \'ae\'b7 c\'e3 v\'b5o th\'eai \'aei\'d3m h\'b5ng h\'e3a \'ae\'ad\'eec giao cho b\'aan thu
\'aa, tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i kho\'b6n 2 v\'b5 kho\'b6n 3 \'a7i\'d2u n\'b5y;
\par 2. B\'aan cho thu\'aa kh\'abng ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 b\'cat k\'fa khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t n\'b5o c\'f1a h\'b5ng ho\'b8 \'ae\'b7 c\'e3 tr\'ad\'edc th\'eai \'aei\'d3m giao k\'d5t h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng m\'b5 b\'aan thu\'aa \'ae\'b7 bi\'d5t ho\'c6c ph\'b6
i bi\'d5t v\'d2 nh\'f7ng khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t \'ae\'e3; 
\par 3. B\'aan cho thu\'aa kh\'abng ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m \'ae\'e8i v\'edi nh\'f7ng khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t c\'f1a h\'b5ng ho\'b8 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'b8t hi\'d6n sau khi b\'aan thu\'aa ch\'cap nh\'cbn h\'b5ng ho\'b8 cho thu\'aa m\'b5 khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t \'ae\'e3 c
\'e3 th\'d3 \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'aan thu\'aa ph\'b8t hi\'d6n n\'d5u th\'f9c hi\'d6n vi\'d6c ki\'d3m tra m\'e9t c\'b8ch h\'eep l\'fd tr\'ad\'edc khi ch\'cap nh\'cbn h\'b5ng h\'e3a; 
\par 4. B\'aan cho thu\'aa ph\'b6i ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 b\'cat k\'fa khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t n\'b5o ph\'b8t sinh sau th\'eai \'aei\'d3m chuy\'d3n r\'f1i ro n\'d5u khi\'d5m khuy\'d5t \'ae\'e3 xu\'cat ph\'b8t t\'f5 vi\'d6c b\'aan cho thu\'aa vi ph\'b9m ngh
\'dca v\'f4 \'ae\'b7 cam k\'d5t c\'f1a m\'d7nh.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 281.}{ Cho thu\'aa l\'b9i
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 1. B\'aan thu\'aa ch\'d8 \'ae\'ad\'eec cho thu\'aa l\'b9
i h\'b5ng ho\'b8 khi c\'e3 s\'f9 ch\'cap thu\'cbn c\'f1a b\'aan cho thu\'aa. B\'aan thu\'aa ph\'b6i ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 h\'b5ng ho\'b8 cho thu\'aa l\'b9i tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3 tho\'b6 thu\'cbn kh\'b8c v\'edi b\'aan cho thu\'aa.

\par 2. Trong tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep b\'aan thu\'aa cho thu\'aa l\'b9i h\'b5ng h\'e3a cho thu\'aa m\'b5 kh\'abng c\'e3 s\'f9 ch\'cap thu\'cbn c\'f1a b\'aan cho thu\'aa th\'d7 b\'aan cho thu\'aa c\'e3 quy\'d2n h\'f1y h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng cho thu\'aa. Ng\'ad\'eai thu
\'aa l\'b9i ph\'b6i c\'e3 tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m tr\'b6 l\'b9i ngay h\'b5ng h\'e3a cho b\'aan cho thu\'aa.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \loch\af31\dbch\af0\hich\f31 \'a7}{\i0 i\'d2u 282.}{ L\'eei \'ddch ph\'b8
