\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 Nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i l\'b5 ho\'b9t 
\'ae\'e9ng th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i, theo \'ae\'e3 b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n cho ph\'d0p v\'b5 y\'aau c\'c7u b\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n t\'f9 m\'d7nh ti\'d5n h\'b5nh vi\'d6c mua b\'b8n h\'b5ng ho\'b8, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 theo c\'b8c \'aei\'d2u ki\'d6
n sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par 1. Vi\'d6c mua b\'b8n h\'b5ng ho\'b8, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 \'ae\'ad\'eec ti\'d5n h\'b5nh theo c\'b8ch th\'f8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c kinh doanh do b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n quy \'ae\'denh v\'b5 \'ae\'ad\'eec g\'ben v\'edi nh\'b7n hi\'d6u h\'b5ng ho\'b8, t
\'aan th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i, b\'dd quy\'d5t kinh doanh, kh\'c8u hi\'d6u kinh doanh, bi\'d3u t\'ad\'eeng kinh doanh, qu\'b6ng c\'b8o c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n;
\par 2. B\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n c\'e3 quy\'d2n ki\'d3m so\'b8t v\'b5 tr\'ee gi\'f3p cho b\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n trong vi\'d6c \'aei\'d2u h\'b5nh c\'abng vi\'d6c kinh doanh.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 285.}{ H\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m
\'b9i
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 H\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m
\'b9i ph\'b6i \'ae\'ad\'eec l\'cbp th\'b5nh v\'a8n b\'b6n ho\'c6c b\'bbng h\'d7nh th\'f8c kh\'b8c c\'e3 gi\'b8 tr\'de ph\'b8p l\'fd t\'ad\'acng \'ae\'ad\'acng.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 286.}{ Quy\'d2n c\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2
n
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 \tab }{\expnd0\expndtw-4 Tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3
 th\'e1a thu\'cbn kh\'b8c, th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n c\'e3 c\'b8c quy\'d2n sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par }{1. Nh\'cbn ti\'d2n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n;
\par 2. T\'e6 ch\'f8c qu\'b6ng c\'b8o cho h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v\'b5 m\'b9ng l\'ad\'edi nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 3. Ki\'d3m tra \'ae\'denh k\'fa ho\'c6c \'ae\'e9t xu\'cat ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n nh\'bbm b\'b6o \'ae\'b6m s\'f9 th\'e8ng nh\'cat c\'f1a h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v\'b5 s\'f9 \'e6n \'ae\'denh v\'d2
 ch\'cat l\'ad\'eeng h\'b5ng ho\'b8, d\'dech v\'f4.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 287.}{ Ngh\'dca v\'f4 c\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'ee
ng quy\'d2n
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 Tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3 th\'e1a thu\'cbn kh\'b8
c, th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n c\'e3 c\'b8c ngh\'dca v\'f4 sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par 1. Cung c\'cap t\'b5i li\'d6u h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n v\'d2 h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i cho b\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n;  
\par 2. \'a7\'b5o t\'b9o ban \'ae\'c7u v\'b5 cung c\'cap tr\'ee gi\'f3p k\'fc thu\'cbt th\'ad\'eang xuy\'aan cho th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n \'ae\'d3 \'aei\'d2u h\'b5nh ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng theo \'ae\'f3ng h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad
\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 3. Thi\'d5t k\'d5 v\'b5 s\'bep x\'d5p \'ae\'dea \'aei\'d3m b\'b8n h\'b5ng, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 b\'bbng chi ph\'dd c\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n;
\par 4. B\'b6o \'ae\'b6m quy\'d2n s\'eb h\'f7u tr\'dd tu\'d6 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng \'ae\'ad\'eec ghi trong h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n;
\par 5. \'a7\'e8i x\'f6 b\'d7nh \'ae\'bcng v\'edi c\'b8c th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n trong h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 288.}{ Quy\'d2n c\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n

\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 \tab Tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3 th\'e1a thu\'cbn kh
\'b8c, th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n c\'e3 c\'b8c quy\'d2n sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par 1. Y\'aau c\'c7u th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n cung c\'cap \'ae\'c7y \'ae\'f1 tr\'ee gi\'f3p k\'fc thu\'cbt c\'e3 li\'aan quan \'ae\'d5n h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 2. Y\'aau c\'c7u th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n \'ae\'e8i x\'f6 b\'d7nh \'ae\'bcng v\'edi c\'b8c th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n kh\'b8c trong h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 289.}{ Ngh\'dca v\'f4 c\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy
\'d2n
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa80\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 \tab }{\expnd0\expndtw-4\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 Tr
\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3 th\'e1a thu\'cbn kh\'b8c, th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'cbn quy\'d2n c\'e3 c\'b8c ngh\'dca v\'f4 sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 1. Tr\'b6 ti\'d2n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n v\'b5 c\'b8c kho\'b6n thanh to\'b8n kh\'b8c theo h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 2. \'a7\'c7u t\'ad \'ae\'f1 c\'ac s\'eb v\'cbt ch\'cat, ngu\'e5n t\'b5i ch\'ddnh v\'b5 nh\'a9n l\'f9c \'ae\'d3 ti\'d5p nh\'cbn c\'b8c quy\'d2n v\'b5 b\'dd quy\'d5t kinh doanh m\'b5 b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n chuy\'d3n giao;
\par 3. Ch\'cap nh\'cbn s\'f9 ki\'d3m so\'b8t, gi\'b8m s\'b8t v\'b5 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n; tu\'a9n th\'f1 c\'b8c y\'aau c\'c7u v\'d2 thi\'d5t k\'d5, s\'bep x\'d5p \'ae\'dea \'aei\'d3m b\'b8n h\'b5ng, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 c
\'f1a th\'ad\'acng nh\'a9n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n;
\par 4. Gi\'f7 b\'dd m\'cbt v\'d2 b\'dd quy\'d5t kinh doanh \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n, k\'d3 c\'b6 sau khi h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i k\'d5t th\'f3c ho\'c6c ch\'cam d\'f8t;
\par 5. Ng\'f5ng s\'f6 d\'f4ng nh\'b7n hi\'d6u h\'b5ng ho\'b8, t\'aan th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i, kh\'c8u hi\'d6u kinh doanh, bi\'d3u t\'ad\'eeng kinh doanh v\'b5 c\'b8c quy\'d2n s\'eb h\'f7u tr\'dd tu\'d6 kh\'b8c (n\'d5u c\'e3) ho\'c6c h\'d6 th\'e8ng c\'f1a b\'aa
n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n khi k\'d5t th\'f3c ho\'c6c ch\'cam d\'f8t h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 6. \'a7i\'d2u h\'b5nh ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi h\'d6 th\'e8ng nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i;
\par 7. Kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n l\'b9i trong tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep kh\'abng c\'e3 s\'f9 ch\'cap thu\'cbn c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n.
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 290.}{ Nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n l\'b9i cho b\'aan th\'f8 ba
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 1. B\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n c\'e3 quy\'d2n nh\'ad\'ee
ng quy\'d2n l\'b9i cho b\'aan th\'f8 ba (g\'e4i l\'b5 b\'aan nh\'cbn l\'b9i quy\'d2n) n\'d5u \'ae\'ad\'eec s\'f9 ch\'cap thu\'cbn c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n. 
\par 2. B\'aan nh\'cbn l\'b9i quy\'d2n c\'e3 c\'b8c quy\'d2n v\'b5 ngh\'dca v\'f4 c\'f1a b\'aan nh\'cbn quy\'d2n quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'a7i\'d2u 288 v\'b5 \'a7i\'d2u 289 c\'f1a Lu\'cbt n\'b5y. 
\par }\pard\plain \s34\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\i\f31\fs28\lang1036\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1036\langfenp1033 {\i0 \'a7i\'d2u 291.}{ \'a7\'a8ng k\'fd nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9
i
\par }\pard\plain \s35\qj \fi709\li0\ri0\sa120\nowidctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f31\fs28\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 1. Tr\'ad\'edc khi nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m
\'b9i, b\'aan d\'f9 ki\'d5n nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n ph\'b6i \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd v\'edi B\'e9 Th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i.}{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 \hich\af31\dbch\af0\loch\f31  }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 
\par }{\expnd-1\expndtw-6 2. Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 quy \'ae\'denh chi ti\'d5t \'aei\'d2u ki\'d6n kinh doanh theo ph\'ad\'acng th\'f8c nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v\'b5 tr\'d7nh t\'f9, th\'f1 t\'f4c \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd nh\'ad\'eeng quy\'d2n th\'ad\'acng m
