\'ae\'e5ng. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep b\'aan vi ph\'b9m giao h\'b5ng ho\'b8, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 k\'d0m ch\'cat l\'ad\'eeng th\'d7 ph\'b6i lo\'b9i tr\'f5 khuy\'d5t t\'cbt c\'f1a h\'b5ng ho\'b8, thi\'d5u s\'e3t c\'f1a d\'dech v\'f4 ho\'c6c giao h\'b5ng kh
\'b8c thay th\'d5, cung \'f8ng d\'dech v\'f4 theo \'ae\'f3ng h\'eep }{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 \loch\af31\dbch\af0\hich\f31 \'ae\'e5}{\lang1036\langfe1033\langnp1036 ng. B\'aan vi ph\'b9m kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec d\'efng ti\'d2n ho\'c6c h\'b5ng kh
